From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: babarot <b4b4r07@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:25:18 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add "Mark as unread" to a space's menu

A finished agent's Done dot clears once its pane is viewed, and herdr
has no way to bring it back; it keeps Done for unviewed completions
only (herdrdev/herdr#4622). The item makes the space's seen idle agents
show Done again until they are viewed. In the focused space, whose
agents are acknowledged on every frame, the marked panes stay unread
until they leave the screen or their agent moves on.
